:: Personality selection [NoSave no-fainting-or-hunger] {"position":"500,400","size":"100,100"}
Choose your own personality:

Select a personality: <<nobr>><<for _i, _value range $personalities>>
    <<capture _i>>
        <<if $personalities[_i].name !== "None">> | <</if>>
        <<link `$personalities[_i].name`>>
            <<set $personality.main.name to $personalities[_i].name>>
            <<set $personality.main.responsesType to $personalities[_i].responsesType>>
            <<set $personality.main.onHit to $personalities[_i].onHit>>
            <<set $personality.main.onCrit to $personalities[_i].onCrit>>
            <<set $personality.main.hitOn to $personalities[_i].hitOn>>
            <<set $personality.main.critOn to $personalities[_i].critOn>>
            <<set $personality.main.npcFlee to $personalities[_i].npcFlee>>
            <<set $personality.main.npcDying to $personalities[_i].npcDying>>
            <<goto "Personality selection">>
        <</link>>
    <</capture>>
<</for>><</nobr>>
Delete a personality: <<nobr>><<for _i, _value range $personalities>>
    <<capture _i>>
        <<if $personalities[_i].name !== "None">> | <</if>>
        <<link `$personalities[_i].name`>>
            <<run delete $personalities[_i]>>
            <<goto "Personality selection">>
        <</link>>
    <</capture>>
<</for>><</nobr>>

Customize your personality:
<<link "Add to personalities">>
    /* I have no idea why or how this works I just saw it from some forum post :sob:
    I cant tell if this is needlessly complicated or not. */
    <<set _count = 0>>
    <<set _tag = "customPersonality">>
    <<for _count = 0; $personalities[_tag]; _count++>>
        <<set _tag = "customPersonality" + (_count + 1)>>
    <</for>>
    <<set $personalities[_tag] = $personality.main>>
    <<goto "Personality selection">>
<</link>>
Name: <<set _barksname = $personality.main.name>><<do>>
  <<textarea "_barksname" _barksname>>
  <<link "Update">>
    <<set $personality.main.name = _barksname>>
    <<redo>>
  <</link>><</do>>
Type: <<set _barksresponsesType = $personality.main.responsesType>><<do>>
  <<textarea "_barksresponsesType" _barksresponsesType>>
  <<link "Update">>
    <<set $personality.main.responsesType = _barksresponsesType>>
    <<redo>>
  <</link>><</do>><<hovertip "This is for possible future purposes.<br>It could define the responses of some random interactions.<br>Use the main personality types for this otherwise it could break.">>(?)<</hovertip>>
Barks whenever you hit: <<set _barksOnHit = $personality.main.onHit.join("\n")>><<do>>
  <<textarea "_barksOnHit" _barksOnHit>>
  <<link "Update">>
    <<set $personality.main.onHit = _barksOnHit.split("\n")>>
    <<redo>>
  <</link>><</do>>
Barks whenever you crit: <<set _barksOnCrit = $personality.main.onCrit.join("\n")>><<do>>
  <<textarea "_barksOnCrit" _barksOnCrit>>
  <<link "Update">>
    <<set $personality.main.onCrit = _barksOnCrit.split("\n")>>
    <<redo>>
  <</link>><</do>>
Barks whenever you're hit: <<set _barksHitOn = $personality.main.hitOn.join("\n")>><<do>>
  <<textarea "_barksHitOn" _barksHitOn>>
  <<link "Update">>
    <<set $personality.main.hitOn = _barksHitOn.split("\n")>>
    <<redo>>
  <</link>><</do>>
Barks whenever you're critted: <<set _barksCritOn = $personality.main.critOn.join("\n")>><<do>>
  <<textarea "_barksCritOn" _barksCritOn>>
  <<link "Update">>
    <<set $personality.main.critOn = _barksCritOn.split("\n")>>
    <<redo>>
  <</link>><</do>>
Barks whenever an ally flees: <<set _barksNpcFlee = $personality.main.npcFlee.join("\n")>><<do>>
  <<textarea "_barksNpcFlee" _barksNpcFlee>>
  <<link "Update">>
    <<set $personality.main.npcFlee = _barksNpcFlee.split("\n")>>
    <<redo>>
  <</link>><</do>>
Barks whenever an ally dies: <<set _barksNpcDying = $personality.main.npcDying.join("\n")>><<do>>
  <<textarea "_barksNpcDying" _barksNpcDying>>
  <<link "Update">>
    <<set $personality.main.npcDying = _barksNpcDying.split("\n")>>
    <<redo>>
  <</link>><</do>>

<<link "Go back">>
    <<goto $lastVisitedPassage5>>
    <<unset $lastVisitedPassage5>>
<</link>>